 study of chest pain characteristics in patients with normal and abnormal coronary angiograms</article-title><source>Heart</source><year>1997</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>146</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evaluation of the patient with chest pain</article-title><source>Modern Treatment (New York)</source><year>1970</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>1169</fpage><lpage>1181</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Le Gal</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Testuz</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Righini</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bounameaux</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Perrier</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reproduction of chest pain by palpation: diagnostic accuracy in suspected pulmonary embolism</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2005</year><volume>330</volume><fpage>452</fpage><lpage>453</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15684025</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/bmj.38331.602384.8F</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eslick</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Usefulness of chest pain character and location as diagnostic indicators of an acute coronary syndrome</article-title><source>American Journal of Cardiology</source><year>2005</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>1228</fpage><lpage>1231</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15877997</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.amjcard.2005.01.052</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-